<title>USA: Baltimore MTA lowers downtown bus and rail fares.</title>
<headline>Baltimore MTA lowers downtown bus and rail fares.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Baltimore's Mass Transit Administration said it would cut bus and light-rail fares to 50 cents in downtown Baltimore.</p>
<p>The drop in the fare from $1.35 is part of a two-year effort to reduce air pollution by encouraging more people to use public transportation, the agency said.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
